<title>USA: TABLE-Cotton States Life Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Cotton States Life Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>COTTON STATES LIFE INSURANCE COMPANY</p>
<p>	    Unaudited Consolidated Summary of Earnings</p>
<p>			     Six months ended   Three months ended</p>
<p>			  6/30/97     6/30/96    6/30/97    6/30/96</p>
<p> Total income    13,291,211  11,469,559  6,874,114  5,706,841</p>
<p>Total benefits &amp; exp.</p>
<p>			9,381,299   8,479,884  4,774,836  4,354,847</p>
<p>Earnings before income</p>
<p>   tax expense    3,909,912   2,989,675  2,099,278  1,351,994</p>
<p>Total Federal Income</p>
<p>   taxes		926,232     608,281    546,898    246,572</p>
<p> Net earnings     2,983,680   2,381,394  1,552,380  1,105,422</p>
<p>Earnings per share</p>
<p>   of common stock*    0.70	  0.56	 0.36	 0.26</p>
<p> Average shrs     4,267,093   4,251,860  4,267,093  4,251,860</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 share and per share amounts have been adjusted for the April 30, 1997 five-for-four stock split.</p>
